arch tool. New categories cover property brokers, Entry-Level Driver Training and Training Provider Registry issues, and registration-related fraud. Medical Review Officer and Substance Abuse Professional complaints now fall under a category called Drug and Alcohol Service Agents. Complaints can be filed online or by phone at 888-368-7238 from 8 a.m. to 8 p.m. ET on weekdays. The agency said filing a complaint does not automatically start an investigation or lead to a penalty.

